{"type":"text","id":"deleg_exp","x":520,"y":810,"width":700,"height":120,"text":"② 父加载器找不到该类时，子加载器才尝试自己加载。\n\n作用：\n• 避免同一个类被重复加载（保证类的唯一性）\n• 防止核心类库（如 java.lang.Object）被篡改，保障安全","originalText":"② 父加载器找不到该类时，子加载器才尝试自己加载。\n\n作用：\n• 避免同一个类被重复加载（保证类的唯一性）\n• 防止核心类库（如 java.lang.Object）被篡改，保障安全","fontSize":15,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":229,"version":1,"versionNonce":229,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25}
